{"schema_version":"1.0","issue_id":"SP-2026-M06","package_id":"frontier-models-june","draft_version":"v0.1","status":"DRAFT","headline":"Frontier Models — 6月、競争は「モデル性能」から提供形態へ広がった","deck":"2026年6月はMiniMax M3、Claude Sonnet 5、Qwen系更新、Gemini API、Kimi Codeが相次いで動いた。重要なのは一列の性能順位ではなく、open-weight、multimodal、API lifecycle、computer-use、coding/agent統合という提供形態の違いである。月末のGPT-5.6はlimited previewであり、7月の本格展開とは分けて読む必要がある。","deck_attribution_mode":"FACTUAL","deck_evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-minimax-news-8be7d33438","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-anthropic-news-afddcb8068","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-alibaba-model-studio-154c528d30","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-google-gemini-api-re-d5b8ea25b2","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-kimi-code-whats-new-788743b9bb","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"}],"blocks":[{"block_id":"chronology-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"6月の流れを、提供形態の変化として読む","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"chronology","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"6月1日のMiniMax M3とAlibaba Model Studioの更新から始まり、Kimi CodeのGoal modeや/swarm、月後半のGemini APIのcomputer-use系更新、6月30日のAnthropicのモデル・科学・安全性関連発表へと、モデルそのものと利用面の更新が並行した。月末にはGPT-5.6 seriesのlimited previewも公表されたが、これは一般提供ではない。","attribution_mode":"MIXED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-minimax-news-8be7d33438","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-alibaba-model-studio-154c528d30","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-kimi-code-whats-new-788743b9bb","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-google-gemini-api-re-d5b8ea25b2","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-anthropic-news-afddcb8068","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-feed-30f48121decc708b123e-bbd0d72643","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"minimax-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"open-weightとcomputer operationを同じモデル面に置くMiniMax M3","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"minimax-model","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"MiniMaxはM3について、MSA sparse attention、最大1M context、画像・動画入力、desktop-computer operation、open weightsを組み合わせたモデルとして説明した。ここで注目すべきなのは、長文脈やmultimodalだけでなく、モデル配布とcomputer-use志向が一つの製品像にまとめられている点である。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-minimax-news-8be7d33438","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"anthropic-update","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"Anthropicの6月30日のnewsroomにはClaude Sonnet 5、Claude Science、Fable 5の再展開と安全性framework更新が同日に並ぶ。モデル更新を単独で見るより、agentic use、科学用途、安全性運用を一つのproduct lifecycleとして束ねていることが6月末の特徴だった。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-anthropic-news-afddcb8068","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"alibaba-lifecycle","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"Alibaba Model Studioの6月はQwen3.7-Plusの更新から始まり、Qwen3.7-Max snapshot、video系、image系へと複数modalのmodel lifecycleが続いた。さらにKimi K2.7 Codeの地域availabilityも記録され、model catalog自体が静的な一覧ではなく、能力・modal・地域提供を継続更新するsurfaceになっている。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-alibaba-model-studio-154c528d30","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"gemini-lifecycle","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"Gemini APIでも、model shutdownやdeprecationと並行してstreaming speech、computer-use、月末の新preview/GAが進んだ。新モデルだけでなく、終了・移行・機能追加を含むAPI lifecycleが利用者の設計条件を変える。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-google-gemini-api-re-d5b8ea25b2","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"kimi-agent","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"Kimi Codeは6月にGoal mode、/swarm、Kimi K2.7 Codeのrelease/open-sourceを段階的に投入した。coding modelの更新を、単発のchat補助ではなくgoal-driven・multi-agentな開発workflowへ接続しようとする動きとして読める。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-kimi-code-whats-new-788743b9bb","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"deepmind-context","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"Google DeepMind側でもDiffusionGemma、Gemma系更新、computer-useやvoice、agent-safety roadmapが6月の公式発信に並んだ。個別modelの優劣より、multimodal生成とagent操作、安全性設計が並行して開発面へ出てきたことが重要である。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-google-deepmind-blog-9b2b580695","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"gpt56-bridge","block_type":"CLAIM_BOUNDARY","text":"OpenAIが6月26日に示したGPT-5.6 seriesはlimited previewであり、Solは小規模なtrusted partner向けを含む限定段階だった。7月の一般提供を6月へ遡及させてはならない。6月号では、翌月の本格展開へつながるchronology bridgeとしてのみ位置付ける。","attribution_mode":"ATTRIBUTED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-feed-30f48121decc708b123e-bbd0d72643","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"distribution-heading","block_type":"HEADING","text":"同じ「frontier」でも、採用判断の物差しは異なる","attribution_mode":"NONE","evidence_refs":[]},{"block_id":"distribution-synthesis","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"open-weightで持ち込めるモデル、managed APIとして更新され続けるモデル、coding/agent環境と一体化したモデルでは、利用者が評価すべきリスクと便益が違う。6月は「最高性能は何か」より、「どの実行環境へ、どの更新速度で、どの操作能力まで持ち込めるか」が競争軸として前景化した月だった。","attribution_mode":"MIXED","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-minimax-news-8be7d33438","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-alibaba-model-studio-154c528d30","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-google-gemini-api-re-d5b8ea25b2","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-kimi-code-whats-new-788743b9bb","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-google-deepmind-blog-9b2b580695","kind":"CLAIM","evidence_id":"claim-1"}]},{"block_id":"boundary-vendor","block_type":"CLAIM_BOUNDARY","text":"各社の公式release pageやnewsroomは、公開日・availability・記載機能を確認する一次資料である一方、capabilityやbenchmarkの優位性まで独立検証したものではない。本稿ではvendorの性能表現をそのまま横断ランキングへ変換しない。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-minimax-news-8be7d33438","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-anthropic-news-afddcb8068","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-alibaba-model-studio-154c528d30","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-google-gemini-api-re-d5b8ea25b2","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-kimi-code-whats-new-788743b9bb","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-index-google-deepmind-blog-9b2b580695","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"}]},{"block_id":"boundary-openai","block_type":"CLAIM_BOUNDARY","text":"GPT-5.6に関する6月時点のcapability、efficiency、performance表現もOpenAIのfirst-party claimとして扱う。limited previewというavailabilityの事実と、性能評価の主張は分離して読む。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2026-M06:item-official-feed-30f48121decc708b123e-bbd0d72643","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"}]}],"must_cover_coverage":[{"requirement":"各releaseのJune chronologyとavailability state","block_ids":["chronology"]},{"requirement":"open-weightとclosed/API提供の差","block_ids":["minimax-model","distribution-synthesis"]},{"requirement":"multimodal・computer-use・coding/agent integration","block_ids":["minimax-model","alibaba-lifecycle","gemini-lifecycle","kimi-agent","deepmind-context"]},{"requirement":"GPT-5.6 limited previewとJuly本格展開を混同しない","block_ids":["gpt56-bridge"]},{"requirement":"vendor benchmark/capability claimsのClaim Boundary","block_ids":["boundary-vendor","boundary-openai"]}],"boundary_coverage":[{"requirement":"This card is derived from the collected first-party index/release-note snapshot. Capability or benchmark language on vendor pages is not independently reproduced.","block_ids":["boundary-vendor"]},{"requirement":"The source is first-party OpenAI material. Capability, benchmark, efficiency, or performance statements remain vendor claims unless explicitly described as externally reproduced.","block_ids":["boundary-openai"]}],"late_breaking_acknowledged":false}